ximum allowed value. memoryRecordSchema -&gt; (structure) Schema for metadata fields on records generated by this strategy. metadataSchema -&gt; (list) The metadata field definitions for this strategy. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 20 (structure) A metadata field definition within a strategy's schema. key -&gt; (string) [required] The metadata field name. Must match an indexed key to be queryable via metadata filters. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 128 o pattern: [a-zA-Z0-9\s._:/=+@-]* type -&gt; (string) The MetadataValueType. Possible values: o STRING o STRINGLIST o NUMBER extractionType -&gt; (string) Specifies whether the metadata value is ex- tracted by the LLM or passed through determin- istically from the event. Possible values: o LLM_INFERRED o STRICTLY_CONSISTENT extractionConfig -&gt; (tagged union structure) Configuration for extracting this metadata value from conversational content. Applicable only if extractionType is LLM inferred. NOTE: This is a Tagged Union structure. Only one of the following top level keys can be set: llmExtractionConfig. llmExtractionConfig -&gt; (structure) Model-based extraction using a definition and instructions. llmExtractionInstruction -&gt; (string) Instructions for extraction. Supports built-in operators like LATEST_VALUE or custom natural-language instructions. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 1000 definition -&gt; (string) [required] Description of what this metadata field represents. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 1000 validation -&gt; (tagged union structure) Validation rules to constrain extracted values. NOTE: This is a Tagged Union structure. Only one of the following top level keys can be set: stringValidation, stringListValidation, numberValida- tion. stringValidation -&gt; (structure) Validation for STRING fields. allowedValues -&gt; (list) [required] Allowed values for this STRING field. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 10 (string) Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 256 o pattern: [a-zA-Z0-9\s._:/=+@-]* stringListValidation -&gt; (structure) Validation for STRINGLIST fields. allowedValues -&gt; (list) Allowed values for items in this STRINGLIST field. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 10 (string) Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 64 o pattern: [a-zA-Z0-9\s._:/=+@-]* maxItems -&gt; (integer) Maximum number of items in the string list. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 5 numberValidation -&gt; (structure) Validation for NUMBER fields. minValue -&gt; (double) Minimum allowed value. maxValue -&gt; (double) Maximum allowed value. JSON Syntax: [ { "semanticMemoryStrategy": { "name": "string", "description": "string", "namespaces": ["string", ...], "namespaceTemplates": ["string", ...], "memoryRecordSchema": { "metadataSchema": [ { "key": "string", "type": "STRING"|"STRINGLIST"|"NUMBER", "extractionType": "LLM_INFERRED"|"STRICTLY_CONSISTENT", "extractionConfig": { "llmExtractionConfig": { "llmExtractionInstruction": "string", "definition": "string", "validation": { "stringValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...] }, "stringListValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...], "maxItems": integer }, "numberValidation": { "minValue": double, "maxValue": double } } } } } ... ] } }, "summaryMemoryStrategy": { "name": "string", "description": "string", "namespaces": ["string", ...], "namespaceTemplates": ["string", ...], "memoryRecordSchema": { "metadataSchema": [ { "key": "string", "type": "STRING"|"STRINGLIST"|"NUMBER", "extractionType": "LLM_INFERRED"|"STRICTLY_CONSISTENT", "extractionConfig": { "llmExtractionConfig": { "llmExtractionInstruction": "string", "definition": "string", "validation": { "stringValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...] }, "stringListValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...], "maxItems": integer }, "numberValidation": { "minValue": double, "maxValue": double } } } } } ... ] } }, "userPreferenceMemoryStrategy": { "name": "string", "description": "string", "namespaces": ["string", ...], "namespaceTemplates": ["string", ...], "memoryRecordSchema": { "metadataSchema": [ { "key": "string", "type": "STRING"|"STRINGLIST"|"NUMBER", "extractionType": "LLM_INFERRED"|"STRICTLY_CONSISTENT", "extractionConfig": { "llmExtractionConfig": { "llmExtractionInstruction": "string", "definition": "string", "validation": { "stringValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...] }, "stringListValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...], "maxItems": integer }, "numberValidation": { "minValue": double, "maxValue": double } } } } } ... ] } }, "customMemoryStrategy": { "name": "string", "description": "string", "namespaces": ["string", ...], "namespaceTemplates": ["string", ...], "configuration": { "semanticOverride": { "extraction": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" }, "consolidation": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" } }, "summaryOverride": { "consolidation": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" } }, "userPreferenceOverride": { "extraction": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" }, "consolidation": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" } }, "episodicOverride": { "extraction": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" }, "consolidation": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string" }, "reflection": { "appendToPrompt": "string", "modelId": "string", "namespaces": ["string", ...], "namespaceTemplates": ["string", ...], "memoryRecordSchema": { "metadataSchema": [ { "key": "string", "type": "STRING"|"STRINGLIST"|"NUMBER", "extractionType": "LLM_INFERRED"|"STRICTLY_CONSISTENT", "extractionConfig": { "llmExtractionConfig": { "llmExtractionInstruction": "string", "definition": "string", "validation": { "stringValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...] }, "stringListValidation": { "allowedValues": ["string", ...], "maxItems": integer }, "numberValidation": { "minValue": double, "maxValue": double } } } } } ... ] } } }, "selfManagedConfiguration": { "triggerConditions": [ { "messageBasedTrigger": { "messageCount": integer }, "tokenBasedTrigger": { "tokenCount": integer }, "timeB